meta {
  name: Get Notice Detail
  type: http
  seq: 2
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/student/notices/{{noticeId}}
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{studentAccessToken}}
}

docs {
  Notice Details screen — title, content, requiredDocuments[] (checklist),
  attachments[] (download links).

  No college_id needed — the notice's own college is looked up server-side
  from its id, then the student's enrollment is checked against that
  college. (Earlier version of this endpoint required college_id as a
  query param; removed since the id alone is enough — the server derives
  and verifies ownership itself rather than trusting a client-supplied
  collegeId.)

  404 if the notice id doesn't exist. 403 if the student has no active
  enrollment at the notice's college.
}
